+ *     (event, arg0, arg1) to the player's own queue;
+ *   - func_00877D40 drains that queue each frame and hands every event to
+ *     func_0087789C, which drives the movie off its own step at player+0x740:
+ *       CALL_COMPLETED(BOOT)  step 1 -> CreateDescriptor, AddDescriptor,
+ *                                       OpenStream, step 2
